  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 1406.02 General Procedure",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 1406.02 General Procedure. The department shall perform an environmental review and prepare an environmental review report based on the applicant’s proposed construction project as specified in Env-Dw 1108.\n\nSource. #13164, eff 1-26-21; ss by #13372, eff 4-21-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw1400.html"
